{"id":"473619","name":"秋葵鸡蛋羹","author":"满宝妈妈","authorId":"9118742","desc":"","cover":"images/473619/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"秋葵","amount":"一颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"生抽","amount":"一小勺"},{"name":"香油","amount":"几滴"},{"name":"盐","amount":"一点"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将鸡蛋磕入碗中，秋葵洗净切片备用。","img":"images/473619/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入大约鸡蛋1.5倍的温水和一点点盐，用筷子搅打均匀。","img":"images/473619/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"过筛一遍，滤掉气泡。","img":"images/473619/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将秋葵片放置在蛋液表面。","img":"images/473619/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入蒸锅。","img":"images/473619/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加盖一个盘子或者蒙上保鲜膜。","img":"images/473619/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大火上汽后蒸七八分钟再焖几分钟。","img":"images/473619/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"出锅后加入生抽和香油。","img":"images/473619/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"这就可以吃啦。","img":"images/473619/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"非常美味。","img":"images/473619/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}